  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "文化是建設ê石磐"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><b>作者：李文正</b></span></p><p><br /></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">有文化內涵ê建設，就是照理路來</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">政府mài烏白建設，環境自然ē得著保護</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">一切ê建設</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">按怎看lóng感覺真順眼</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">文化是國家族群ê根，語言是文化ê靈魂</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">建設親像一件藝術ê作品，充滿真善美hiah-nī suí</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">無文化做底ê建設，一定走tsing</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">按怎看lóng感覺真粗魯</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">無了解家己ê文化，就親像稻草人</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">空有好看ê外殼，親像無靈魂ê性命</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">按怎看lóng感覺無魂附體</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">建設若破壞自然ê美感，對環境造成傷害</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">一切建設lóng是假，一切經濟mā是假--ê</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">親像塗沙、粗糠，風吹--來就無--去--ah！</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">未tsîng學行先學飛，食無三把蕹菜tsiūnn西天</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">按怎看lóng感覺tsiok虛hua</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">國家若beh有深度，ē受人尊重</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">現代化、先進、有主體性</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Ài有文化做基礎，就ē有特色，親像建立tī石磐</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\">按怎看lóng m̄驚天搖地tshuah</span></p><div><br /></div><p><br /></p><p><br /></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span><b>做伙來唸詩</b></span><b><span>專欄，</span><span>本文使用教育部推薦漢字kap臺灣閩南語羅馬字拼音方案。</span></b></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><b>台文通訊BONG報323期，2021年2月出刊。</b></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\">歡迎捐款贊助　李江却台語文教基金會　（捐款thang抵稅，匯款了後請通知02-23112199）</span></div><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><div><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\">線上捐款(定期定額)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" href=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fppt.cc%2FfF5bhx&amp;h=AT1fIGbvLe-H1RfIAEmaBwSoHSud2mWn8lrfo0xPDXLyCEJ6_oyPKdt-VNpBwe2ie9QCjJZfObjdC0zbQCynJ54D2Wi_b8ZrVcDWstK8-oYv8FmldyEJo_KdoHuWC05sSueoTuSvJ5cr-p_vScPimOGX4wzN4y0tm93TSYPwa_Oy3MkFQCQALsRTZFMOuwZl3PJcYWBoT4jwc6LmmvFHGmEYyMh57UFUGaQo8oSSuqcQD7MKG6wLN7MfjP3hZh1vLhHapsOOcRjYmtcIPyZgahNTgWaTFPQekTNcLnwDRhPn5DUPgyHeN0NWy-eAvWaf1orAzEnaT0bXGSBh6WL5ZAg_4sea_VdaRcccV0V-eEdDhNVVJKe0z-BljR9iJL_jWIDn2Jg-L_StZx71NBmaz7xd3VsLzNHGj2fO28pTvMz9QEOhl9nJrC80TCbPW5QlyDfD0ZK9o_8n3YOoDoX6PLV_4rNk2cvzW43qFquAkjfncrxhxCKH-VY6Kf7T3qxnHFKyq5jaEBd-Gzbx3BOuAS0L2ZAq5p4l1ciYXkt6XOQM7lnaWciPYKDMH73hsYXjsMWMXsK2AWmIxmqDhr3wrIhYsOOwJNPzsMyjmPbI9ddmSRJ_pqcuxGjmrXlJMqFxxpVrD6GXJGkN7wZj5MfSb2YRcg\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" style=\"cursor: pointer;\" target=\"_blank\">https://ppt.cc/fF5bhx</a></span></div></div><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><div><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-family: inherit;\">線上捐款(單筆)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" data-lynx-uri=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fppt.cc%2Ffcycox&amp;h=AT0H6xWALxkqKTZY4xK9Odg526LM77N2q_ltt_Y8nC4_ki5ZoWyAjPPNaKyF6_djXJ_obDEOkx__7WMdaTUsGNOmfg_FDe_nfhDB9cW9M2iyHMHquKL9nqCFMpuMwCF5Gby8kOWjHu6nBgAoYPsZcF2smrFzZVzSNSg